name: extra-dataflow-sink-program
mapping: dataflow
spec: 4.2
expect: bash
runnable: true
=== dot ===
digraph { gl_mapping=dataflow
  a[shape=box label="printf 'b\na\n'"]
  b[shape=box label="tr a-z A-Z"]
  a -> b [label="sort"]
}
=== modl ===
#gl mapping=dataflow
a square printf 'b\na\n'
b square tr a-z A-Z                    # a program with inputs reads them on stdin
a -> b sort
=== bash ===
printf 'b\na\n' | sort | tr a-z A-Z
